flowchart LR
  SCHEMA[Protocol schema and source] --> ANDROID[Gradle tests/lint/build]
  SCHEMA --> FW[PlatformIO native tests and target build]
  ANDROID --> HOST[Host model/source checks]
  FW --> HOST
  ANDROID --> APK[Reviewed APK]
  FW --> BIN[Board/profile-specific firmware]
  APK --> PHONE[Install on authorized physical phone]
  BIN --> HUD[Flash only matching board/profile]
  PHONE --> E2E[Pair, sync, reconnect, media/settings scenarios]
  HUD --> E2E
  E2E --> EVID[Redacted logs, reports and real visual evidence]
  EVID --> RELEASE[Review checklist and release decision]
  HOST -. not hardware proof .-> RELEASE
